{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NMqmqGAciW1794473354.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國產純太陽能無人機「輕騎兵」，首飛成功。</p><p></p><p>中國航天科技集團自主研發的「輕騎兵」無人機，周三在西北一個機場，按預定程序啟動電機，平穩滑行、加速離地，爬升至預定高度，繞場盤旋後平穩著陸，順利完成各系統驗證，狀態良好。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRONE-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EqLNnwe63U1794473297.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這款商用級中小型純太陽能無人機，機型長3.2米、翼展8米，最大設計續航時間達30小時，最高可升至7,000米，具備超過5公斤的載荷能力，並採用車載起飛方式，地面準備時間只需20分鐘，毋須依賴傳統機場，未來可廣泛應用於水利防汛及應急搶險等領域。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.DRONE-1500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026imJwx0P9Db1794473239.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.638411+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:18:14.408928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:27.726238+00:00","content_hash":"46506fa672d88148cc1860507cb52564dab055412326536773f5d4f7100728b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.638411+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}